{%- comment -%}
  One small classification under a provenance stage — "HANDWOVEN",
  "UNDYED / SOURCE PAGE", "HAND FINISHED / UNVERIFIED" in the V2 design.
  `tag` is the classification; when it is blank the stage's fact is unknown and
  the tag reads the confirm text. `known` is the fact the tag rests on; a tag
  with no fact behind it never claims verification.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign label = tag
  assign is_open = false
  if label == blank
    assign label = confirm | default: '[Confirm]'
    assign is_open = true
  endif
  assign suffix = ''
  if show_status
    if is_open or known == blank
      assign suffix = ''
    elsif verified
      assign suffix = ''
    else
      assign suffix = ' / Unverified'
    endif
  endif
-%}
<p class="ha-provenance__tag ha-record{% if is_open %} ha-provenance__tag--open{% elsif suffix != '' %} ha-provenance__tag--unverified{% endif %}">{{ label }}{{ suffix }}</p>
